1
00:00:00,085 --> 00:00:01,755
When we find it, wanna go with us?

2
00:00:02,338 --> 00:00:06,338
- To do what?
- Party with the pretty girls, dude.

3
00:00:06,842 --> 00:00:09,382
(Leonard:)Are you insane?
You're not gonna party with them.

4
00:00:09,553 --> 00:00:11,433
You're not even gonna get near
that place.

5
00:00:11,597 --> 00:00:15,097
(Howard:)That's what they said to Neil Armstrong
about the moon.

6
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:17,607
(Sheldon:)No one said anything of the kind
to Neil Armstrong.

7
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:20,650
(Sheldon:)The entire nation dedicated a decade
of effort and treasure...

8
00:00:20,814 --> 00:00:22,104
(Sheldon:)...to put a man on the moon.

9
00:00:22,274 --> 00:00:24,614
(Howard:)My fellow Americans,
before this year is out...

10
00:00:24,777 --> 00:00:28,447
(Howard:)...we will put a Wolowitz
on one of America's Top Models.

11
00:00:29,907 --> 00:00:33,117
(Raj:)And a large number of people
will believe it never happened.

12
00:00:34,662 --> 00:00:35,742
(Penny(arriving):)Okay, let me guess.

13
00:00:35,913 --> 00:00:37,373
(Penny(arriving):)Quesadilla with soy cheese...

14
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,670
- ...for lactose-intolerant Leonard.
- Thank you.

15
00:00:39,833 --> 00:00:42,833
(Penny:)Shrimp caesar salad with no almonds
for the highly allergic...

16
00:00:43,003 --> 00:00:45,383
(Penny:)...kosher-only-on-the-High-Holidays
Howard.

17
00:00:45,548 --> 00:00:48,048
(Penny:)And for our
suddenly-back-on-the-Hindu-wagon Raj...

18
00:00:48,217 --> 00:00:49,757
...meat lover's pizza, no meat.

19
00:00:52,012 --> 00:00:53,432
(Penny:)Coming right up.

20
00:00:53,597 --> 00:00:56,937
(Sheldon:)Wait. Excuse me. You forgot
my barbecue bacon cheeseburger...

21
00:00:57,101 --> 00:00:59,431
(Sheldon:)...barbecue sauce,
bacon and cheese on the side.

